27:T4df,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Taif from Al Baha by road?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 220 km, around 2 hours 40 minutes of driving before stops. Mountain bends and weather can add time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book from Taif Airport straight to Al Baha?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Send your flight number; we track the flight and meet you at arrivals at Taif Regional Airport (TIF), with 15–30 minutes of free waiting."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which vehicle suits the mountain road?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A sedan is fine for one to three people with normal luggage; a full-size SUV gives families more room. We confirm the vehicle with your quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is a taxi from Taif to Al Baha?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The fare is fixed and agreed on WhatsApp before you book. It depends on the vehicle, addresses and whether you need a return."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a return from Al Baha to Taif?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Ask for both legs in one request and each is agreed before you travel."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] pb-28 text-[#1C1C1C] lg:pb-16","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Taif to Al Baha private transfer\",\"description\":\"Taif to Al Baha is about 220 km by road through the Sarawat highlands, around 2 hours 40 minutes of driving before stops. Taxi Saudi Arabia arranges a private car with driver from any Taif hotel, home or Taif Regional Airport (TIF) to an address in Al Baha, with one fixed fare agreed on WhatsApp before booking.\",\"serviceType\":\"Private intercity transfer\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/routes/taif-to-albaha\",\"provider\"